**`/courses/optyka-vs-sar-porownawcza-wizja-komputerowa/lessons/pipeline-optyczny-detekcja-statkow.json`** — 6 sections (2 theory + 4 widgets), 18 min, validates against `LessonSchema` and passes `findLessonAssetIssues`.
Structure:
1. **theory** — overview of the 3-stage pipeline (water mask → `blob_log` → filter), with inline flow-diagram image
2. **plotImage** — 4-panel figure on the real SEN12MS tile (RGB / water mask + buffer / 162 raw `blob_log` candidates / 53 filtered detections covering all 8 truth ships)
